# ===========================================================================
# Language Translation Tool - environment template (root)
# ===========================================================================
# This file documents every environment variable used by the project.
#
#   * Backend  : copy `backend/.env.example` -> `backend/.env`, then fill in
#                real values. The backend reads `.env` from its working
#                directory.
#   * Frontend : copy `frontend/.env.example` -> `frontend/.env` ONLY when
#                you need to override the API base URL (see that file).
#
# NEVER commit a real `.env` file. All `.env` files are git-ignored.
# ===========================================================================

# ------------- BACKEND (backend/.env) -------------
#
# TRANSLATION_PROVIDER=google|mock
#   "google" -> real calls to the Google Cloud Translation API.
#   "mock"   -> offline canned responses; no credentials required (great for
#               running the app and tests without a GCP account).
#
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-gcp-project-id
#   Required when TRANSLATION_PROVIDER=google.
#
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=C:\path\to\service-account.json
#   Path to a Google service-account key file (Application Default
#   Credentials). Alternatively: `gcloud auth application-default login`.
#
# TRANSLATION_LOCATION=global
# TRANSLATE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=10.0
# MAX_TEXT_LENGTH=5000
# DEFAULT_SOURCE_LANGUAGE=en
# ENVIRONMENT=development
# DEBUG=false
# LOG_LEVEL=INFO
# CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173
# RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=true
# RATE_LIMIT_REQUESTS=60
# RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_SECONDS=60

# ------------- FRONTEND (frontend/.env) -------------
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
#   Leave empty for the Vite dev proxy (/api -> http://127.0.0.1:8000).
#   Set to a hosted backend base URL only if needed:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
#   Only VITE_-prefixed variables reach the browser; never put secrets here.

# See README.md for a full reference and setup instructions.